Already applied, just sync version info.

Signed-off-by: liutianyu1250 <liutianyu1250@phytium.com.cn>

Link: https://gitee.com/phytium_embedded/phytium-linux-kernel/commit/22dc1a2b3e
Signed-off-by: Kexy Biscuit <kexybiscuit@aosc.io>
